      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T00:35:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s pretty unclear why this permission is used here ; an unaware reader would probably assume that apps with this permission should be automatically granted local network permission. This will become a problem if we forget to change this in the future.\n\nSuggestion : make a constant with the planned name for the actual permission in this file with a comment on why it\u0027s done this way, e.g.\n```\nThe LOCAL_NETWORK_ACCESS is not available yet. For the time being, use\nNEARBY_WIFI_DEVICES as a means to develop, for expediency. TODO : remove\nthis constant when the LOCAL_NETWORK_ACCESS permission is defined.\nprivate static final int LOCAL_NETWORK_ACCESS \u003d NEARBY_WIFI_DEVICES;\n````\n...and then use the constant throughout.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1301,
        "startChar": 46,
        "endLine": 1301,
        "endChar": 65
      },
      "revId": "dbb9478fd54ccf0949c60cc222039374ed13a6b0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
